	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "ALPS SPPH4 series vertical push switch with location lug (SPPH410100 latching, SPPH410200 momentary), 6 terminals 2.5 mm pitch, rows 5.4 mm, per ALPS SPPH4 datasheet. Both poles paralleled for a 2-pin symbol: pad 1 = commons (ALPS 2, 5), pad 2 = normally-open contacts closed when pressed/latched (ALPS 3, 6); ALPS 1 and 4 (normally closed) are unconnected. The location lug sits on the NO (3/6) side.")
	(tags "ALPS SPPH4 SPPH410100 SPPH410200 push switch latching")
